        "not_source_quote": true,
        "not_source_erratum": true,
        "zh": "采用普通折射棱镜的平面光路模型：棱镜折射率高于同一外部介质，光线从构成折射顶角的两个侧面进入和射出，没有内部全反射。",
        "en": "Use the ordinary planar refracting-prism model: the prism has a higher refractive index than the same surrounding medium, and light enters and exits through the two faces meeting at the refracting apex, without internal total reflection."
