      "source_text": "7. 棱镜的截面是等边三角形，要使光线通过棱镜发生折射时，入射点与出射点到顶点的距离相等，棱镜物质的折射率$n$的最大许可值是多少？",
      "source_figure_refs": [],
      "modern_clarification": {
        "id": "T13-Q7-M01",
        "not_source_quote": true,
        "not_source_erratum": true,
        "zh": "棱镜材料折射率仍记为 n，入射面和出射面外侧是同一介质，其折射率记为 n_a，均为正；不假定 n_a 等于 1。入射点和出射点位于两相邻侧面，到共同折射顶点距离相等。只计真正进入、穿过并射出棱镜的非掠射光线。",
        "en": "Keep n for the prism material index. The same external medium on both faces has positive index n_a; do not assume n_a=1. Entry and exit lie on adjacent faces at equal distances from their common refracting apex. Count only nongrazing rays that actually enter, cross and leave the prism."
      },
